"KDE Interactive Geometry"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:19
#, kde-format
msgid "(C) 2002-2005, The Kig developers"
msgstr ""
"(C) 2002-2005, The Kig programeri"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:23
#, kde-format
msgid "David E. Narvaez"
msgstr ""
"David E. Narvaez"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Current maintainer."
msgstr ""
"Trenutni održavatelj."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Dominique Devriese"
msgstr ""
"Dominique Devriese"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Original author, former maintainer, design and lots of code."
msgstr ""
"Originalni autor, bivši održavatelj, dizajn i puno koda."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Maurizio Paolini"
msgstr ""
"Maurizio Paolini"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:28
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Did a lot of important work all around Kig, including, but not limited to "
"conics, cubics, transformations and property tests support."
msgstr ""
"Radio je mnogo važnog posla oko Kiga, uključujući, ali ne ograničavajući se na konike, kubike, transformacije i podršku za testove svojstava."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Pino Toscano"
msgstr ""
"Pino Toscano"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:34
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Former maintainer, Dr. Geo import filter, point and line styles, Italian "
"translation, miscellaneous stuff here and there."
msgstr ""
"Bivši održavatelj, Dr. Geo filtar za uvoz, stilovi točka i linija, prijevod na talijanski, razne stvari tu i tamo."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:39
#, kde-format
msgid "Franco Pasquarelli"
msgstr ""
"Franco Pasquarelli"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:40
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Helped a lot with the implementation of the Locus object, there's quite some "
"math involved in doing it right, and Franco wrote the most difficult parts."
msgstr ""
"Puno je pomogao u implementaciji objekta Locus, ima dosta matematike uključene u to kako treba, a Franco je napisao najteži dijelovi."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:45
#, kde-format
msgid "Francesca Gatti"
msgstr ""
"Francesca Gatti"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:46
#, kde-format
msgid "Responsible for the computation of the algebraic equation of a locus."
msgstr ""
"Odgovorna za izračun algebarske jednadžbe lokusa."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Petr Gajdos"
msgstr ""
"Petr Gajdos"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Contributed the Bézier curves and related icons."
msgstr ""
"Doprinijela Bézierovim krivuljama i povezanim ikonama."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Raoul Bourquin"
msgstr ""
"Raoul Bourquin"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Contributed the 'asymptote' export filter."
msgstr ""
"Doprinio je izvoznom filtru 'asymptote'."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:54
#, kde-format
msgid "Eric Depagne"
msgstr ""
"Eric Depagne"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:55
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The French translator, who also contributed some useful feedback, like "
"feature requests and bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Francuski prevoditelj, koji je također dao neke korisne povratne informacije, kao što su zahtjevi za značajke i izvješća o pogreškama."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:59
#, kde-format
msgid "Marc Bartsch"
msgstr ""
"Marc Bartsch"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:60
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Author of KGeo, where I got inspiration, some source, and most of the "
"artwork from."
msgstr ""
"Autor KGeo-a, odakle sam dobio inspiraciju, neki izvor i većinu umjetničkih djela."

#: kig/aboutdata.h:64
#, kde-format
msgid "Christophe Devriese"
msgstr ""
"Christophe Devriese"

#: kig/aboutdata.h:65
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Domi's brother, who he got to write the algorithm for calculating the center "
"of the circle with three points given."
msgstr ""
"Domijev brat, kojem je došao napišite algoritam za izračunavanje središta kruga s tri zadane točke."

